<title>USA: Consumer prices post modest April gain.</title>
<headline>Consumer prices post modest April gain.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices advanced modestly in April, the government said on Thursday, offering more proof that inflation remains largely in check.</p>
<p>The Labor Department said the Consumer Price Index rose 0.1 percent last month, matching the 0.1 percent rise in March.</p>
</text>
